[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3446895439","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112011#issuecomment-3446895439","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112011","id":3446895439,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Nc3NP","user":{"login":"fire","id":32321,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMzIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32321?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire","html_url":"https://github.com/fire","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-25T16:49:10Z","updated_at":"2025-10-25T16:49:10Z","body":"> Have the include/exclude filtering use the actual resource paths rather than the exported paths.\r\n\r\nFor a future pull request, I think the dependency code for checking resources is broken, it might be working or not. The best way to save sizes is to not include a resource into a pck.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3446895439/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3450731754","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112011#issuecomment-3450731754","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112011","id":3450731754,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Nrfzq","user":{"login":"mihe","id":4884246,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODQyNDY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4884246?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe","html_url":"https://github.com/mihe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-27T11:06:45Z","updated_at":"2025-10-27T11:13:04Z","body":"> Have the include/exclude filtering use the actual resource paths rather than the exported paths.\r\n\r\n@bruvzg Since you'll be taking a look at this PR at some point anyway, I'd be curious to hear your take on this potential improvement. I noticed that the encryption filtering in the export dialog has the same \"problem\", so I figured it might warrant being changed at the same time as this.\r\n\r\nThe UX surrounding these filters is arguably not great right now, since often times the relative paths end up not being the same as the original file, so trying to exclude all textures by adding `textures/*` (or whatever) to the exclude filter won't actually work, since their paths are in the form of `.godot/imported/*.png-*.ctex` instead. The user would presumably have to be aware of the resulting PCK \"structure\" to make any sort of informed decision about the filters, and even then it's impossible to filter out only some textures in a particular folder, since they all get put into `.godot/imported` in a flat structure.\r\n\r\nI'm not entirely sure how to best fix this, but I'm assuming it would require passing the original path alongside the exported/remapped path into `EditorExportSaveFunction` in `EditorExportPlatform::export_project_files`?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3450731754/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3457983502","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112011#issuecomment-3457983502","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112011","id":3457983502,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7OHKQO","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-28T18:42:10Z","updated_at":"2025-10-28T18:42:10Z","body":"> Have the include/exclude filtering use the actual resource paths rather than the exported paths.\r\n\r\nIndeed, it is the issue, https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/87696 include an attempt to fix it by adding `source_path` to the PCK file add function and checking it against filters as well as target path.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3457983502/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3458052186","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112011#issuecomment-3458052186","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112011","id":3458052186,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7OHbBa","user":{"login":"mihe","id":4884246,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODQyNDY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4884246?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe","html_url":"https://github.com/mihe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-28T19:01:34Z","updated_at":"2025-10-28T19:01:34Z","body":"> #87696 include an attempt to fix it by adding `source_path` to the PCK file add function and checking it against filters as well as target path.\r\n\r\nRight, yeah. I was tempted to make a similar change as your `ExportFileData` thing there. The amount of arguments to `EditorExportSaveFunction` is getting to be a bit much.\r\n\r\nI can try to extract that `ExportFileData` part into its own PR if/when this PR is merged.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3458052186/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3521893933","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112011#issuecomment-3521893933","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112011","id":3521893933,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7R69Yt","user":{"login":"mihe","id":4884246,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODQyNDY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4884246?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe","html_url":"https://github.com/mihe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-12T13:16:57Z","updated_at":"2025-11-12T13:16:57Z","body":"Rebased to resolve conflicts.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3521893933/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"